# The environment is the pinned `so101-nexus` package — this app vendors no
# MJCF, no meshes and no scene of its own.
#
# `src/.../env/assets/` is a LEFTOVER: ~18 MB of menagerie STLs that the
# removed `scripts/fetch_assets.sh` used to vendor. Nothing reads it any more
# and it is safe to delete. It stays ignored so a `git add -A` on a machine
# that still has it cannot sweep 18 MB of binaries into a commit.
src/vla_pick_and_place/env/assets/

